      value: '<b>Ignition Key</b>

        Controls the ignition key. Click to select
        position.






        <b>Input Monitor</b>

        Shows the main inputs
        and states of the car.











        <b>Gear Mode Selector</b>

        Used
        in Automatic Transmission only. Click to select a specific gear mode or use
        Page-Up/Page-Down to select next/prev mode.









        <b>Dashboard</b>

        Shows
        Speed, RPMs, engaged gear, and status signals.















        <b>Driving
        Aids</b>

        See the "Aids" section in the top menu.'
